Legend (colour is only decoration: the words are always printed)
 + ok     checked and fine
 x FAIL   checked and wrong
 ? unverified  not verified: nothing measured it
 ! WARN   works, weaker than recommended
 - skip   left out, or not offered
| ACTION  something you must do or answer

    a command you can copy


